@StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5045
@branch_id = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

# Requires InventoryService with demo data. Copy IDs from Inventory:
# GET http://localhost:5041/api/stock/branch/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@product_id = PRODUCT_ID
@order_id = ORDER_ID
@line_id = LINE_ID
@purchase_order_id = PURCHASE_ORDER_ID

### 1. Create a sales order (201, Draft)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": "{{branch_id}}",
  "notes": "Counter sale"
}

### 2. Add a line; the unit price is the product's sale price in Inventory (200)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{product_id}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 3. Change the line quantity (200)
PUT {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}/lines/{{line_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### 4. Confirm: issues stock in Inventory (200 Confirmed; 409 insufficient stock; 503 Inventory unavailable)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}/confirm

### 5. Get the order with its lines and stock movement IDs (200)
GET {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}

### 6. List orders with filters (200)
GET {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders?status=Confirmed&branchId={{branch_id}}&from=2026-01-01&page=1&pageSize=20

### 7. Cancel a draft order (200; 409 for a confirmed order)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel

### 8. Create a purchase order (201, Draft)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": "{{branch_id}}",
  "supplierName": "Acme Tools"
}

### 9. Add a line; the unit cost is the product's purchase price in Inventory (200)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchase_order_id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{product_id}}",
  "quantity": 10
}

### 10. Place the purchase order with the supplier (200, Ordered)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchase_order_id}}/place

### 11. Receive the goods: records receipts in Inventory (200, Received)
POST {{StockSync.Orders.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchase_order_id}}/receive
